  "A demo approved coach profile for testing the real-person coach workflow.",
  "Avery reviews saved trades, compares them against the AI coach focus, publishes weekly feedback, and assigns one or two concrete follow-through tasks.",
  "This seeded profile is local demo data. Replace it with a real approved coach before live use.",
].join("\n\n");

